<title>USA: Smith Barney cuts stocks in asset allocation.</title>
<headline>Smith Barney cuts stocks in asset allocation.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney equity strategist Marshall Acuff reduced stocks in the firm's asset allocation to 45 percent from 50 percent, his office said.</p>
<p>Cash was raised to 15 percent from 10 percent, while bonds were unchanged at 40 percent, his office said.</p>
